  "content": "ssss[Intro:]\n<link rel=\"image3\" href=\"img/dmc0.png\">\n\n{{D7}}[1/1]{{D7}}[1/1]\n\n>>>>riff Guitare 2:\n<link rel=\"image4\" href=\"img/dmcriffG2.png\">\n\nvvvv[Verse 1:]                     \n  {{D7}}[1/1]Asked a girl what she wan{{G7}}[1/1]ted to be\n  {{D7}}[1/1]She said baby, {{G7}}[1/1]can't you see\n  {{D7}}[1/1]I wanna be famous, a {{G7}}[1/1]star on the screen\n  But{{A}}[1/1] you can do something {{A}}[1/1]in between\n\n\nrrrr[Chorus1:]\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{G7}}[1/1]car\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Yes I'm gonna be a {{G7}}[1/1]star\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{E}}[1/2]car\n<link rel=\"image1\" href=\"img/dmc1.png\">\nAnd may{{A}}[1/2]be I'll l{{D}}[1/2]ove y{{G}}[1/2]ou{{A}}[1/1]\n\nvvvv[Verse 2:]\n  {{D7}}[1/1]I told that girl that my {{G7}}[1/1]prospects were good\n  {{D7}}[1/1]And she said baby, {{G7}}[1/1]it's understood\n  {{D7}}[1/1]Working for peanuts {{G7}}[1/1]is all very fine\n  But {{A}}[1/1]I can show you a b{{A}}[1/1]etter time\n\n\npppp[Chorus2:]\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{G7}}[1/1]car\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Yes I'm gonna be a {{G7}}[1/1]star\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{E}}[1/2]car\n<link rel=\"image1\" href=\"img/dmc1.png\">\nAnd may{{A}}[1/2]be I'll l{{D}}[1/2]ove y{{G}}[1/2]ou\n{{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep yeah\n\n\nssss[Solo:]\n{{D7}}[1/1]  {{G7}}[1/1]  {{D7}}[1/1]  {{G7}}[1/1]  {{D7}}[1/1]  {{G7}}[1/1]  {{A}}[1/1]  {{A}}[1/1]\n<link rel=\"image2\" href=\"img/dmc2.png\">\n\nrrrr[Chorus3:]\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{G7}}[1/1]car\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Yes I'm gonna be a {{G7}}[1/1]star\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{E}}[1/2]car\n<link rel=\"image1\" href=\"img/dmc1.png\">\nAnd may{{A}}[1/2]be I'll l{{D}}[1/2]ove y{{G}}[1/2]ou{{A}}[1/1]\n\n\nvvvv[Verse 3:]\n  {{D7}}[1/1]I told that girl I could {{G7}}[1/1]start right away\n  {{D7}}[1/1]And she said listen babe I got {{G7}}[1/1]something to say\n  {{D7}}[1/1]I've got no car and it's {{G7}}[1/1]breaking my heart\n  But I'{{A}}[1/1]ve found a driver and th{{A}}[1/1]at's a start\n\n\npppp[Chorus fin:]\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{G7}}[1/1]car\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Yes I'm gonna be a {{G7}}[1/1]star\n{{Bm}}[1/1]Baby you can drive my {{E}}[1/2]car\n<link rel=\"image1\" href=\"img/dmc1.png\">\nAnd may{{A}}[1/2]be I'll l{{D}}[1/2]ove y{{G}}[1/2]ou\n {{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep {{D}}[1/2]yeah {{G}}[1/2]                  \n {{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep {{D}}[1/2]yeah {{G}}[1/2]                  \n {{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep {{D}}[1/2]yeah {{G}}[1/2]                  \n {{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep {{D}}[1/2]yeah {{G}}[1/2]                  \n {{A}}[1/1]Beep beep'm beep beep {{D}}[1/2]yeah {{G}}[1/2]                  \n\n\n\n>>>>The Beatles, prononcé en français [bi.tœlz], est un groupe de rock \n>>>>britannique originaire de Liverpool, \n>>>>en Angleterre. Il est considéré comme le groupe le plus \n>>>>populaire et influent de la musique populaire occidentale.",
